{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1793467789,"nonce":"qhyTkO0+au7aTmDjBA0/8ILBpOk=","title":"An app can ask for frame latency 2 and a present mode while a surface animates","message":"**What**\n\nrayde-00 measured RayDE's live surface preview (a headless app's picture streamed into a tab that redraws every frame) on the Mac with ASHUI_FRAME_STATS=1 and a 3 s sample. Under the default Fifo, frames came at 52-54 per second with 17.8-18.8 ms in drawing, and 1576 of 1769 main-thread samples were inside -[CAMetalLayer nextDrawable] waiting on a semaphore; the draw work itself is about 2 ms. With ASHUI_PRESENT_MODE=immediate the tick holds at 8-12 ms and about 58-59 frames a second arrive, at the cost of display sync and a loop that draws at about 120 Hz.\n\n**Suspected cause**\n\nWindowedApp.configure() sets desiredMaximumFrameLatency(1) (for event-driven latency, 0973e0c's reasoning), which on Metal means two drawables (wgpu sets maximumDrawableCount to latency + 1). Under Fifo a frame that misses a refresh then waits a second one. Not yet measured with latency 2.\n\n**What is feasible**\n\nMetal under wgpu-hal 30 offers present modes Fifo and Immediate only, so there is no Mailbox on this Mac; Mailbox is for Wayland, where paceOnRedraw is on. Frame latency on Metal is 1..=2 (maximumDrawableCount 2..3), so 3 is not available. ashui already draws only when dirty or animating, so presenting only when new content arrived is how the loop works; a surface that redraws every frame keeps it dirty every frame.\n\n**To do**\n\nAdd an app-level setting on WindowedApp for the frame latency and present mode, which RayDE sets while a continuously animating surface is visible and clears to latency 1 and Fifo when it stops; reconfigure the surface when it changes. Add ASHUI_FRAME_LATENCY=1|2 as an env override (a value the surface does not allow fails or clamps at configure, say which). Measure Fifo with latency 2 on the Mac before choosing a default.\n\nRequested by rayde-00, for darmie's testing. Not started.","files":null}]}